WEBVTT

00:04:58.871 --> 00:05:01.221
But we had to do it.

00:05:01.221 --> 00:05:05.342
Our community deserved a new way of doing things.

00:05:05.342 --> 00:05:08.868
And as the very first pilot middle school

00:05:08.868 --> 00:05:12.093
in all of Los Angeles Unified School District,

00:05:12.093 --> 00:05:15.069
you better believe there was some opposition.

00:05:15.069 --> 00:05:17.192
And it was out of fear --

00:05:17.192 --> 00:05:20.415
fear of, well, what if they get it wrong?

00:05:20.415 --> 00:05:22.600
Yeah, what if we get it wrong?

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:24.854
But what if we get it right?

00:05:24.854 --> 00:05:26.929
And we did.

00:05:26.929 --> 00:05:29.540
So even though teachers were against it

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:32.121
because we employ one-year contracts --